  "title": "AUTOSAR DLT: remove some unnecessary code.",
  "description": "All AUTOSAR DLT packes have the encapsulation type\nWTAP_ENCAP_AUTOSAR_DLT, so set the file encapsulaion type to that,\nrather than starting out as \"unknown\" and then, for each new interface\nadded (which always has that encapsulation type), setting the file\nencapsulation type to that value if the current type is unknown or, if\nit's not unknown and isn't the same, setting it to \"per-packet\".\n\n(That code may have been copied-and-pasted from a file handler for a file\nthat *does* have multiple encapsulation types.)",
